# 一台 station 的记忆 over 记忆 on the tape (MBUI_FIXTURE=settings-memories MBUI_WIN=700x760): Studio's memory opened,
# then swiped by a finger from its panel's edge 60 across and let go (short of a third: it stays).
timeout 20000
until 全局记忆 · 项目记忆
wait 1200
tap Studio
wait 1800
drag 70 400 60 0 600
wait 1500
exit
